# The contract this site is generated against.
#
# It used to be a hand-vendored fork that had not been touched since 8 August
# and sat a BREAKING version behind: 0.0.0-proposal against the canonical
# 1.1.0, with ten paths against twenty-two. `Media`, `Slot` and
# `ExperienceSummary` had different shapes, and three paths in the copy
# (`/auth/otp/request`, `/auth/otp/verify`, `/me`) had been deleted upstream
# entirely. Nothing detected any of it — see yuvoy-web#135.
#
# This is now the same mechanism yuvoy-app and yuvoy-operator use, pinned to
# the same commit, so all three frontends reason about one backend.
#
# `pnpm contract:check` fails the build if this copy stops matching the ref.
# When the contract moves: re-pull, `pnpm codegen`, commit both.
